也许我们太守旧了
Maybe we're being old-fashioned,

181
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,540
非要用性别来约束这两个角色
defining these roles by gender.

182
00:08:14,540 --> 00:08:16,580
你知道  在历史上
You know, historically, the best man's role

183
00:08:16,580 --> 00:08:18,800
伴郎的任务就是在战斗中保护新娘新郎
was to defend the bride and groom in combat.

184
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,840
如果这不选佩妮来做
I mean, if that's not Penny,

185
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:21,640
那我们根本就是在搞笑啊
I don't know what we're doing here.

186
00:08:23,110 --> 00:08:24,560
我懂你意思
I see your point.

187
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:28,500
好吧  那我们同时开启伴男
Okay, we are officially open to a best woman

188
00:08:28,500 --> 00:08:30,580
和伴女的选拔
and a gentleman of honor.

189
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:32,350
这些名字真难听
Oh, those names are terrible.

190
00:08:32,350 --> 00:08:34,340
给你减一分
One point off for you.

191
00:08:35,470 --> 00:08:36,940
你给我计分干什么
What am I being tested for?

192
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:39,110
这不重要  但如果你没通过
Oh, it's not important. But if you don't pass,

193
00:08:39,110 --> 00:08:41,000
现在做的这些也用不上了
none of this matters.

194
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:44,300
下一项测试是什么
Okay, what's the next test?

195
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:45,720
忠诚度
Loyalty.

196
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:48,130
我们得选一个靠得住的人
We need to choose someone who has our backs,

197
00:08:48,130 --> 00:08:51,880
能保密的人  甚至要帮我们瞒住彼此
someone who will keep our secrets even from each other.

198
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:53,600
我对你没有任何秘密啊
Well, I don't have any secrets from you.

199
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,380
你有秘密瞒着我吗
Do you have secrets from me?

200
00:08:55,380 --> 00:08:56,750
当然有
Yes.

201
00:08:58,710 --> 00:09:00,650
这件事压在我心头上好久了
Oh, that has been weighing on me for years.

202
00:09:00,650 --> 00:09:01,980
快过来抱抱
Come here.

203
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:08,370
你觉得自己算是个忠诚可靠的朋友吗
Would you call yourself a loyal and trustworthy friend?

204
00:09:08,370 --> 00:09:10,140
我是呀
Yeah, I like to think so. ?

205
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:13,340
太好了  因为我要给你讲一件霍华德的事
Great. Because I need to tell you something about Howard,

206
00:09:13,350 --> 00:09:15,140
但你不能告诉他是我说的
but you can't tell him that I told you.

207
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:16,960
别  不想听
Nope. Don't want to hear it.

208
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,530
我一点也不想听八卦
Do not like to engage in gossip.

209
00:09:19,530 --> 00:09:22,840
好吧  我敬佩你的人品
Okay. I respect your integrity.

210
00:09:24,190 --> 00:09:25,210
是不是关于他那条特殊内裤的
Is it about his special underwear?

211
00:09:25,210 --> 00:09:27,710
因为我早就知道了  我只说这么多
Because I already know. And that's all I'll say.

212
00:09:29,940 --> 00:09:32,600
好啦  里面有个木炭屁味过滤器
Fine, it has a charcoal filter in it.

213
00:09:34,650 --> 00:09:37,320
你能过来陪我  真是太有心了
It's really sweet of you to come by and keep me company.

214
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:39,490
我也这么认为
Agreed. Uh...

215
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:44,490
听着  我有个秘密
So, listen, I have a secret

216
00:09:44,490 --> 00:09:46,510
很想跟人分享
that I need to tell someone.

217
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:48,730
但你绝对不能说出去
But you can never say a word.

218
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:49,980
哪怕对霍华德也不能说
Not even to Howard.

219
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:52,060
没问题  告诉我吧
I'm your girl. Lay it on me.

220
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:54,020
真的吗
Really?

221
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:56,410
你对你老公也有保留秘密吗
You keep things from your husband?

222
00:09:56,410 --> 00:09:57,670
不  我什么都告诉他
No, I tell him everything.

223
00:09:57,670 --> 00:09:59,590
你别傻了
Don't be a child.

224
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:03,630
好吧  告诉你
Okay. Here it is.

225
00:10:04,270 --> 00:10:06,250
我可以通过手机操控
I can control the thermostat

226
00:10:06,250 --> 00:10:09,410
莱纳德公寓的恒温器
in Leonard's apartment with my phone.

227
00:10:09,410 --> 00:10:12,070
当他惹我生气时
And when he makes me mad,

228
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:15,550
我就把温度稍微上调几度
I turn it up, slightly.

229
00:10:17,650 --> 00:10:20,180
我都不知道你来了
Oh, hey. I didn't know you were here.

230
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:22,060
你们俩在聊什么呀
What are you two talking about?

231
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:26,440
真心没任何意义的事
Literally, nothing interesting.

232
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,740
你真会保守
Oh, you're good.

233
00:10:31,110 --> 00:10:36,170
排行榜  伴郎/伴女  伴娘/伴男

234
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:36,560
接下来  准时到达典礼
Okay, getting to the ceremony on time.

235
00:10:37,060 --> 00:10:38,790
莱纳德  快点  你得在一个小时内
Leonard, quick. I need you to get me

236
00:10:38,790 --> 00:10:40,100
把我送到亚凯迪亚
to Arcadia within the hour.

237
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:41,710
火车模型商店正在大打折
The train store's having a sale.

238
00:10:41,710 --> 00:10:43,500
艾米为什么不送你去
Why can't Amy drive you?

239
00:10:43,510 --> 00:10:47,060
因为按传统来说  在火车模型商店打折那天
Because of the tradition that I cannot see Amy

240
00:10:47,060 --> 00:10:49,200
我不能和艾米碰面[应是婚礼前]
on the day of the train store sale.

241
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:53,120
拜托你  去看看医生好不好
Please, please see a doctor.

242
00:10:54,630 --> 00:10:57,410
-下一项测试  -先等一下
- Next test. - ?Just wait one second.

243
00:11:01,410 --> 00:11:03,270
是不是有点变热啊
Is it getting hot in here?

244
00:11:09,050 --> 00:11:10,830
抱歉  我们说到哪儿了
I'm sorry. Where were we?

245
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:14,470
我们的朋友是否了解我们
How well do our friends know us?

246
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:17,230
我给我最爱的阿姨打电话...
So I was talking to my favorite aunt...

247
00:11:17,230 --> 00:11:19,070
多伊阿姨  对吧
Aunt Doe, right?

248
00:11:19,530 --> 00:11:21,130
完全正确
Exactly.

249
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:24,190
她最后弄清楚膝盖上的东西是什么了吗
Did she ever figure out what that thing on her knee was?

250
00:11:24,260 --> 00:11:26,450
后来发现是巧克力碎
Turns out it was a chocolate chip.

251
00:11:27,220 --> 00:11:30,060
很有可能  她很喜欢烘焙
Hmm. Makes sense, she does like to bake.

252
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:33,490
没错  哇  你真是种子选手
Yes, she does. Damn, you are a thoroughbred.

253
00:11:34,890 --> 00:11:37,620
处理婚礼前的怯场情绪
You know, dealing with cold feet

254
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:41,990
也是伴娘伴郎的重要任务之一
is an important part of being both best man and maid of honor.

255
00:11:41,990 --> 00:11:44,600
也许我们应该测试一下这项能力
Maybe we should test for that ability.

256
00:11:45,990 --> 00:11:48,450
你真的觉得自己会怯场吗
You really think you might get cold feet?

257
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:52,020
其实  我是在说你
Actually, I was talking about you.

258
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,710
艾米
Amy...

259
00:11:54,050 --> 00:11:56,660
如果这世上我只坚信一件事
if there's one thing in this world I'm sure of,

260
00:11:56,660 --> 00:11:58,940
那就是你的担心是对的
you are right to be worried.

261
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:02,280
晚安
Good night.

262
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:07,670
霍华德
Howard.

263
00:12:07,670 --> 00:12:10,910
我看上了这个限量版的沼泽怪物
I've had my eye on this limited edition Swamp Thing,

264
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:12,610
但我在下单之前
but now that I'm about to buy it,

265
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:16,030
我又有点犹豫了  你怎么看
I'm having second thoughts. What do you think?

266
00:12:16,390 --> 00:12:19,140
我不知道啊  谢尔顿  这玩意挺贵的
I don't know, Sheldon, it's pretty expensive.

267
00:12:19,150 --> 00:12:22,120
没错  但是如果它让我开心呢
Yes, but what if it will make me happy, you know,

268
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:26,310
余生每天清晨起来都能看到它在我枕边
waking up and seeing it every morning for the rest of my life?

269
00:12:26,310 --> 00:12:30,150
真的吗  一个会走路的烂沼泽草吗
Really, a walking clump of swamp grass?

270
00:12:30,410 --> 00:12:32,910
伯纳黛特也没多棒好吗
Yeah, well, Bernadette's no prize either!

271
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,620
你在干什么呢
Hey, what you doing? ?

272
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:40,210
谢尔顿给我出了道题  挺好玩的
Sheldon gave me a brain teaser. It's kind of fun.

273
00:12:40,210 --> 00:12:41,980
一群人共进晚餐
It's about a group of people at dinner,

274
00:12:41,990 --> 00:12:44,930
你得找出让他们不吵架的座位安排
and you have to figure out where they can sit without fighting.

275
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:47,720
是不是那个草绿先生不可以
Oh, yeah, is this the one where Mr. Green

276
00:12:47,730 --> 00:12:49,840
和吃肉的人坐在一起
can't sit next to anyone eating meat,

277
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,110
浅蓝叔叔
and Uncle Light Blue

278
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:54,160
身边不能有比他颜色深的人
won't sit next to any of the darker colors?

279
00:12:55,830 --> 00:12:57,720
没错  谢尔顿也发给你了吗
Yeah, did Sheldon send it to you?

280
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:59,490
艾米发的  我已经做出来了
Amy did. I solved it already.

281
00:12:59,490 --> 00:13:00,370
-真的吗  -真的
- Really? - ?Yeah.

282
00:13:00,370 --> 00:13:02,190
就像对待我的陪审团义务传票一样
Same way I solved my jury duty summons,

283
00:13:02,190 --> 00:13:04,320
直接丢了
I threw it away.

284
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:05,960
不行  不行  不行
No, no, no, no, no.

285
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:08,400
橙黄阿姨不可以坐在吧台边
Uh, Aunt Orange can't sit next to the bar

286
00:13:08,410 --> 00:13:09,790
粉红小姐会说
without Ms. Pink saying,

287
00:13:09,790 --> 00:13:12,530
"我滴神呀  你喝太多酒了"
"Jesus thinks you've had enough whiskey."

288
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:17,250
谢尔顿和艾米也给你们出那道题了吗
Did Sheldon and Amy give you guys that puzzle, too?

289
00:13:17,250 --> 00:13:20,590
是的  是我多心  还是他们最近变得很怪
Yeah. Is it just me or have they been acting strange?

290
00:13:20,590 --> 00:13:22,660
是一直怪  不是才变的
I don't think they're acting.

291
00:13:24,610 --> 00:13:25,340
对啊  之前有一天
Yeah, the other day,

292
00:13:25,340 --> 00:13:27,350
谢尔顿叫我带他去火车模型商店
Sheldon made me take him to the train store.

293
00:13:27,350 --> 00:13:28,810
我们都没进去  他就说了句
We didn't go inside. He just said,

294
00:13:28,810 --> 00:13:31,400
"做得很好"  我们就回家了
"Nicely done," and then we went home.

295
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:34,230
是啊  艾米给了我这个塑料戒指
Yeah, and Amy gave me this plastic ring

296
00:13:34,230 --> 00:13:35,550
叫我保管好
and told me to hold on to it.

297
00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:37,330
-我也有一只  -一样的
- I got one, too. - Yeah, same.

298
00:13:37,330 --> 00:13:38,760
我也有
Yeah, me, too.

299
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:40,700
不过  被小桂子吞了
But-but Cinnamon ate it.

300
00:13:42,620 --> 00:13:44,870
我明天才能"找回来"
I-I'll get it back tomorrow.

301
00:13:49,190 --> 00:13:51,190
不得不说  进行得真顺利啊
I have to say, this is going pretty well.

302
00:13:51,190 --> 00:13:52,190
没错
It is.

303
00:13:52,190 --> 00:13:55,660
如果用人类做试验在道德上是错的
I-If experimenting on humans is morally wrong,

304
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:57,980
那我不想当个道德正确的人
then I don't want to be morally right.

305
00:13:59,470 --> 00:14:00,770
你们是不是在测试我们
Hey, are you testing us

306
00:14:00,780 --> 00:14:03,000
谁够格当伴郎伴娘
to see who gets to be in your wedding?

307
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,630
-是的  -不是
- Yes. ?- No.

308
00:14:05,660 --> 00:14:07,650
他们在给我们打分
Wha-- they're rating us.

309
00:14:07,650 --> 00:14:10,190
我竟然是最后一名吗
And I'm in last?

310
00:14:10,780 --> 00:14:12,460
别慌  还有时间
Don't panic, there's still time.

311
00:14:12,460 --> 00:14:15,210
这可是马拉松  不是短跑
Look, it's a marathon, not a sprint.

312
00:14:16,390 --> 00:14:17,730
知道吗  这太侮辱人了
You know what, this is so insulting.

313
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:19,590
我都不想当你的伴郎了
I-I don't even want to be your stupid best man.

314
00:14:19,590 --> 00:14:20,690
-没错  -我也不想
- Yeah. ?- Me neither.

315
00:14:20,690 --> 00:14:21,900
等等  等等
W-W-Wait, wait.

316
00:14:21,900 --> 00:14:24,830
好奇问一句  是谁先意识到的
Just out of curiosity, which one of you figured it out?

317
00:14:24,830 --> 00:14:26,220
是我
I did.

318
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:29,700
真棒
Impressive.

319
00:14:36,790 --> 00:14:37,960
你好  斯图尔特
Hello, Stuart.

320
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,050
好啊  谢尔顿
Oh, hey, Sheldon.

321
00:14:39,050 --> 00:14:41,950
想喝杯卡布奇诺吗
Can I interest you in a cappuccino?

322
00:14:42,350 --> 00:14:44,070
你何时开始卖咖啡了
When did you start selling those?

323
00:14:44,070 --> 00:14:46,830
有人忘在这儿了  不过还是温的
Oh, someone left it here, but it's still warm.

324
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,420
算你四块钱怎么样
Say four bucks?

325
00:14:52,210 --> 00:14:53,860
不用了  谢谢
No, thank you.

326
00:14:54,220 --> 00:14:55,740
没出什么事吧
Oh. Everything okay?

327
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:57,020
这个嘛
Well...

328
00:14:57,020 --> 00:14:59,450
我暗中在我朋友身上做试验
I secretly experimented on my friends,

329
00:14:59,450 --> 00:15:02,030
现在他们都不想当我的伴郎了
and now none of them want to be my best man.

330
00:15:02,030 --> 00:15:05,380
也就是些寻常的婚礼破事
So, you know, normal wedding drama.

331
00:15:06,700 --> 00:15:07,580
抱歉
Sorry.

332
00:15:07,590 --> 00:15:09,930
可能得让我那蠢哥哥来做伴郎了
Probably have to use my stupid brother.

333
00:15:09,930 --> 00:15:13,070
准备好他用咯吱窝来说婚礼祝酒词吧
So get ready for a wedding toast delivered by his armpit.

334
00:15:13,660 --> 00:15:15,360
要是你真的不想让你哥当伴郎
Well, if you really don't want to use your brother,

335
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:17,460
我愿意当你伴郎
I'd be your best man.

336
00:15:18,330 --> 00:15:19,360
真的吗
Really?

337
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:21,800
对啊  我们是朋友啊
Yeah, we're friends.

338
00:15:21,810 --> 00:15:23,190
再说  这也挺好的
Plus, it'd be nice.

339
00:15:23,190 --> 00:15:26,770
伴郎的英文是"最佳男人"

340
00:15:23,190 --> 00:15:26,770
我从未被称为"最佳"
Never really been called the best before.

341
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:29,810
说起来  也没被称为"男人"过
Or a man, for that matter.

342
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,600
好吧  谢谢你  斯图尔特
Okay, well, uh, thank you, Stuart.

343
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:35,130
谢谢你的好意
That's a very generous offer.

344
00:15:35,130 --> 00:15:36,660
不客气
My pleasure.

345
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:41,590
据我所知  伴郎通常会收到一份礼物
I-I understand the best man usually receives a present.

346
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:43,940
此话不假
That's true.

347
00:15:45,070 --> 00:15:47,130
开瑞坦[抗过敏药]永远都不嫌多啊
Can never have too much Claritin.

348
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:54,820
你还在解谢尔顿的那道破题吗
You're still working on Sheldon's dumb brain teaser?

349
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:58,820
老天啊  紫博士是个女人  当然了
Oh, my God, Dr. Purple's a woman! Of course!

350
00:15:58,930 --> 00:16:01,790
感觉太爽了
Oh, that feels so good.

351
00:16:02,570 --> 00:16:03,750
大家好
Hello.

352
00:16:03,750 --> 00:16:07,500
我想我该向三位道个歉
I believe I owe the three of you an apology.

353
00:16:08,450 --> 00:16:10,230
毋庸置疑
No argument here.

354
00:16:11,460 --> 00:16:13,490
通过拿你们做试验
By experimenting on you,

355
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:16,250
我意识到我伤害了你们对我的信任
I realize I've violated your trust

356
00:16:16,250 --> 00:16:19,670
被认为是国际人道法的标准

357
00:16:16,250 --> 00:16:19,670
可能也违反了《日内瓦公约》
and possibly the Geneva Convention.

358
00:16:20,890 --> 00:16:22,090
说完了吗
Is that it?

359
00:16:22,090 --> 00:16:23,080
还没有
No.

360
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:25,470
所以为了不再进一步惹恼你们
So as to not upset any of you further,

361
00:16:25,470 --> 00:16:27,800
我已经邀请了斯图尔特当我的伴郎
I've asked Stuart to be my best man,

362
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:29,220
他也答应了
and he's agreed.

363
00:16:29,220 --> 00:16:31,380
你们仍然欢迎来参加单身派对
You're all still invited to the bachelor party.

364
00:16:31,380 --> 00:16:35,250
他想在好市多超市举行  主题是"光看不买"
Uh, he's thinking Costco and the theme is browsing.

365
00:16:36,170 --> 00:16:38,250
你选斯图尔特也不选我们吗
You picked Stuart over one of us?

366
00:16:38,250 --> 00:16:39,590
我本来想选你们其中一个
Well, I wanted to choose one of you,

367
00:16:39,590 --> 00:16:41,680
但你们都离我而去了
but you all turned against me.

368
00:16:41,690 --> 00:16:45,600
选伴郎不是通过计分选出的
Picking a best man isn't about keeping score.

369
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:47,160
但你们都是我的朋友
But you're all my friends.

370
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,700
如果我不收集数据
I mean, if I didn't collect data,

371
00:16:48,700 --> 00:16:51,770
我哪有办法从你们三人之中选出一个呢
how could I possibly choose among the three of you?

372
00:16:51,770 --> 00:16:54,280
这话还挺暖的
Well, that's actually kind of sweet.

373
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:57,220
是吗  可能我表达得不对
Is it? Perhaps I said it wrong.

374
00:16:58,350 --> 00:17:01,570
这是你的婚礼  选你想要的人就行了
Look, this is your wedding, just pick whoever you want.

375
00:17:01,570 --> 00:17:03,610
除了你自己  你谁都不必考虑
You don't need to worry about anyone else but yourself.

376
00:17:03,610 --> 00:17:06,570
你也算是为今天训练了一辈子
You've kind of been training for this your whole life.

377
00:17:07,710 --> 00:17:09,410
谢谢你  莱纳德
Thank you, Leonard.

378
00:17:09,620 --> 00:17:12,820
如果有帮助的话  这两人都是半途而废的主
And if it helps... these two are quitters.

379
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:17,620
你在煮什么呢
Hey, what you making?

380
00:17:17,630 --> 00:17:19,620
我把芝士调味包给撒了
Uh, well, I spilled the cheese packet,

381
00:17:19,620 --> 00:17:22,770
所以我们今晚吃无料通心粉
so we're having mac and nothing.

382
00:17:23,490 --> 00:17:24,910
我就吃通心粉好了
Yeah. I'll just have the mac.

383
00:17:24,910 --> 00:17:26,840
"无料[芝士]"会让我放屁
"Nothing" gives me gas.

384
00:17:30,260 --> 00:17:31,630
你心情为什么这么好
Why are you in such a good mood?

385
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:33,070
我刚跟谢尔顿聊过
Mm, I just talked to Sheldon.

386
00:17:33,070 --> 00:17:36,530
他为试验的事道歉了  并邀请我当他的伴郎
He apologized about the tests and asked me to be his best man.

387
00:17:36,530 --> 00:17:39,700
太好了  你为他付出了那么多  他应该请你的
Uh, great. After all you've done for him, he should've asked you.

388
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:41,160
艾米是你最好的朋友
And Amy's your best friend.

389
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:43,250
她肯定会醒悟过来选你的
I'm sure she'll come to her senses and pick you.

390
00:17:43,250 --> 00:17:45,440
她才不是呢  我们又不是什么12岁少女
Okay, she's not my best friend. We're not 12.

391
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,930
如果她想选伯纳黛特当她的伴娘
If she wants Bernadette to be her maid of honor,

392
00:17:46,930 --> 00:17:48,270
我真的不在乎
I really don't care.

393
00:17:48,270 --> 00:17:49,450
听起来你挺在乎啊
Sounds like you care.

394
00:17:49,450 --> 00:17:51,440
不  我只是觉得不爽
No, I mean, it-it's just annoying.

395
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:53,650
我们每天都聊天  无时无刻不在一起
You know, we talk every day. We see each other all the time.

396
00:17:53,650 --> 00:17:55,570
她总是在我身边陪着我  基本上...
She's always there for me, and basically--

397
00:17:55,570 --> 00:17:58,110
天啊  艾米真是我最好的朋友
oh, my God, Amy's my best friend.

398
00:18:00,290 --> 00:18:01,820
你还好吧
You okay?

399
00:18:02,010 --> 00:18:04,880
不好  我最好的朋友没邀请我当她的伴娘
No, my best friend didn't ask me to be her maid of honor.

400
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,560
老娘气炸了
I'm pissed!

401
00:18:09,030 --> 00:18:13,440
总之  你的行为是错误又残酷的
So, bottom line, what you did was wrong and cruel,

402
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:17,650
而我孩子的妈莫名觉得被打动了
which the mother of my children finds oddly appealing.

403
00:18:18,460 --> 00:18:20,640
这么说  她仍然想当我的伴娘吗
So she still wants to be my maid of honor?

404
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:22,170
伴娘  女杀手  随你需要
Maid of honor, hit woman, whatever you need.

405
00:18:22,170 --> 00:18:23,560
打电话吧
Make the call.

406
00:18:25,670 --> 00:18:27,340
听着  我知道这是你的婚礼
Look, I know this is your wedding,

407
00:18:27,340 --> 00:18:28,540
你想怎样都可以
and you can do whatever you want,

408
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:30,900
但如果你找除我以外的人当伴娘
but if you think anyone but me is gonna be your maid of honor,

409
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:33,760
那你就是大白痴  因为你是我最好的朋友
then you're an idiot because you are my best friend.

410
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:34,660
太晚了  伯纳黛特...
Too late. Bernade...

411
00:18:34,660 --> 00:18:36,320
好闺蜜
Bestie!

412
00:18:45,380 --> 00:18:46,920
斯图尔特  如果谢尔顿
Stuart, I'm sorry if it's weird

413
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:49,610
选我当伴郎没选你  让你不舒服了  我道歉
Sheldon made me best man instead of you.

414
00:18:49,620 --> 00:18:50,300
没关系
It's okay.

415
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:53,360
我好歹也当了两天伴郎
I was best man for two whole days.

416
00:18:55,570 --> 00:18:58,060
谁都不能夺走这一殊荣
No one can take that away from me.

417
00:18:59,230 --> 00:19:01,780
除了谢尔顿  他夺走了
Except for Sheldon, when he did.

418
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:05,530
不过  要是你想参与婚宴
Although, if you want to be a part of the wedding party,

419
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:08,110
你也可以当女花童
I suppose you could be the flower girl.

420
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,760
成交
Sold.

421
00:19:13,570 --> 00:19:16,260
女花童不是要让哈雷当吗
Well, I thought Halley was gonna be the flower girl.

422
00:19:16,260 --> 00:19:17,490
那样合适多了
Oh, that's much better.

423
00:19:17,490 --> 00:19:19,310
抱歉  斯图尔特  你出局了
Sorry, Stuart, you're out.

424
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:23,990
伯纳黛特对我当伴娘没意见吗
Hey, so is Bernadette okay with me being maid of honor?

425
00:19:23,990 --> 00:19:27,550
其实我还没勇气告诉她
Actually, I haven't had the courage to tell her.

426
00:19:28,130 --> 00:19:29,460
我想应该由我来说
I guess I should do that.

427
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:30,880
是的
Uh, yeah.

428
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:35,220
不过  身为伴娘
Although, as maid of honor,

429
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:37,940
你的工作就是为我分担解忧
your job is to make my life easier.

430
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:40,050
我靠
Damn it.

431
00:19:40,060 --> 00:19:42,960
斯图尔特  你还想参与这个婚礼吗
Hey, Stuart, you still want in on this wedding?

432
00:19:45,530 --> 00:19:47,590
也没那么想
Not that much.

433
00:19:49,030 --> 00:19:51,690
好吧  我去说
Fine. I'll do it.

434
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:55,150
不过帮个忙  先把酒柜的儿童防护锁打开
But do me a favor and unlock the liquor cabinet first.

